  "source_conclusion": "For the two checked implementations, prefill attention in every layer consumes the original full K/V. Compressed/retrieved K/V are prepared as the cache for subsequent single-token decoding. Therefore this K-aggregation intervention has no structural data path into the first output token logits, given the same prompt/model/generation settings.",
